cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use bioroster in your work, please cite it as below.
title: "bioroster: Subject and Sample Rosters for Genomics Studies"
abstract: >-
  An R package that keeps the subjects, samples, and analysis outputs of a
  genomics study in one validated object, with a long-format sample manifest,
  pipeline sample sheets, an analysis registry, and pluggable cross-species
  translation backends.
type: software
version: 0.1.0.9000
